		Heading 1:
			Text: Case
		Paragraph: `Case` paints the text in uppercase, in lowercase or with the first letter of each word in capitals. The text is written normally and a screen reader, or a copy from the PDF, gets it as written. Every line below is written "Customer details of the Nogal workshop".
